==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool '''74 MILLION''' downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On from August 29th (11:00am) until September 12th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#339966|'''even days (8/30, 9/2, 9/4, 9/6, 9/8, 9/10, 9/12)'''}} visit {{Color|#339966|Empire of Cats}}, and on {{Color|#00FFFF|'''odd days (8/29, 8/31, 9/1, 9/3, 9/5, 9/7, 9/9, 9/11)'''}} head to {{Color|#00FFFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event! Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on 8/31, 9/3, 9/6, 9/9, 9/12!

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of 20 Cat Food each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

